UID:ms-2026-early-last@civic-forecast.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261027T020342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Last day of early voting (Mississippi)
DESCRIPTION:Mississippi has no open early voting. If you qualify (for exam
 ple\, age 65 or older\, a disability\, working during polling hours\, or 
 being away from home on Election Day)\, you can vote in person at your ci
 rcuit clerk's office Monday to Friday\, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. The last day is 
 Saturday\, Oct. 31\, from 8 a.m. to noon.\nMore: https://myelectionday.so
 s.state.ms.us/VoterOutreach/Pages/VOSearch.aspx\nFrom The Civic Forecast:
  https://civic-forecast.pages.dev
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://myelectionday.sos.state.ms.us/VoterOutreach/Pages/VOSearch.asp
 x
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Last day of early voting (Mississippi)
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
