DESCRIPTION:You can apply for\, renew\, or change a 2027 health plan on He
 althCare.gov from November 1 through January 15. Sign up by December 15 i
 f you want coverage to start January 1.\nMore: https://www.healthcare.gov
 /quick-guide/dates-and-deadlines/\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://civic
 -forecast.pages.dev
