UID:ms-2026-mail-due@civic-forecast.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261027T020342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:Last day mailed ballots can arrive (Mississippi)
DESCRIPTION:Mississippi mail ballots are only for certain voters\, such as
  people 65 or older\, people with a disability\, or people living outside
  their county. The ballot must be postmarked by Nov. 3 and reach the circ
 uit clerk's office within 5 business days (by 5 p.m. on Nov. 10). The sta
 te also tells voters to get ballots in as early as they can.\nMore: https
 ://www.sos.ms.gov/elections-voting\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://civi
 c-forecast.pages.dev
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.sos.ms.gov/elections-voting
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Last day mailed ballots can arrive (Mississippi)
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
