DTSTAMP:20261027T020342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:SSI raise shows up in payments
DESCRIPTION:About 7.3 million people on SSI get their January payment on D
 ecember 31\, with the 3.6 percent cost-of-living raise included. Nothing 
 to sign up for\; it is automatic.\nMore: https://www.ssa.gov/news/en/pres
 s/releases/2026-10-14.html\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://civic-foreca
 st.pages.dev
