DESCRIPTION:Nearly 72 million people on Social Security will see a 3.6 per
 cent bigger payment starting in January 2027. You do not have to apply\; 
 look for a letter from Social Security in December.\nMore: https://www.ss
 a.gov/news/en/press/releases/2026-10-14.html\nFrom The Civic Forecast: ht
